@lu D'Fréijoer ass eng immens schéi Joreszäit fir mech.
@distractor-lu Wanter
@distractor-lu dreckeg
@en The spring is an enormously beautiful season for me.
@distractor-en winter
@distractor-en dirty

@sentence
